<title>JAPAN: Korea Industrial Leasing launches Euroyen - Nikko.</title>
<headline>Korea Industrial Leasing launches Euroyen - Nikko.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Euroyen issue was announced by lead manager Nikko Securities on Tuesday:</p>
<p> BORROWER	  The Korea Industrial Leasing Co, Ltd.</p>
<p> GUARANTOR	 Korea Development Bank (KDB)</p>
<p> AMT		 10 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON	    2.20 pct</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 99.85</p>
<p> MATURITY	  7 August 2002</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  7 August 1997</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     S&amp;P AA-</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Nikko Securities</p>
<p>NOTE: Syndicate group will be formed during London hours on Tuesday.</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8584</p>
</text>
